  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A metal block of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is suspended from a rigid support through a metal wire of diameter <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math>. The tensile stress developed in the wire under equilibrium state is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The value of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is ______ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kg</mi></math>.</p><p>(Take&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math>)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "11",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The data given is</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Using the equation</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mi>A</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>49</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>49</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow><mn>98</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
